  k3: Beside it is a 48 megapixel ultra wide with a 120 degree view. It can also focus close enough for macro shots. Both are the same class of camera as the standard iPhones.
  k8: For selfies, there's a 12 megapixel center stage camera on the outer screen, in a module so thin it fits inside a 5mm half, and on the inside, the camera under the screen.
  k9: Folding adds new tricks too. Stand it up like a tent and Smart Capture takes the photo when everyone's ready, or turn on dual screen preview so the people in the photo can see themselves on the outer screen. Next, sound and touch.
